// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig for local builds (the copy is git-ignored).
// macOS ties the Microphone, Accessibility and Input Monitoring permissions and
// the app's preferences to the bundle identifier, so keep yours stable.
// Without this file the app is io.github.zigansh1n.velikiy-moguchiy, as the
// published builds are. Builds from before the rename used nz.owo.koe (koe's
// identifier): put it here to keep the permissions granted to them, or choose
// your own for a fork and grant them once.
MAC_APP_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = io.github.zigansh1n.velikiy-moguchiy
